--  Feed A Mosquito  |  Matcha LuaVM menu tab (UI.AddTab)
--
--  v11.7
--
--  HIDE UNDER FARM  (fixed: it stays under now)
--    1. Every BasePart of the character is anchored, not just the
--       HumanoidRootPart, so a script that unanchors your root cannot
--       drop the body.
--    2. The root CFrame and both velocities are written every frame.
--    3. Drift no longer switches the hide off. It used to bail after
--       ~0.75 s of drift, which is exactly what you were seeing. Now
--       it just re-writes and carries on; it prints one line the
--       first time drift is seen and nothing else.
--    4. On respawn the new character is teleported to the hide spot
--       first, then anchored, so the body never sits at spawn.
--    5. Only two things switch it off: 3 deaths in 25 s, or health
--       falling below 30% of what it was when you hid.
--
--  EGG PICKUP  (stealth)
--    With Hide Under Farm on, the body stays anchored under the map
--    and only the root moves for the pickup, so nothing of you is
--    visible above ground. The hop is: settle 0.06 s, fire, 0.03 s,
--    fire again, back. No no-clip on the body unless it is not hidden,
--    and the root is put back in the same pass. Per-egg cooldown 0.6 s
--    so it does not hammer the prompt.
--
--  UNCHANGED
--    Farm Kill: size cycle, firetouchinterest, Attack/PlaySound burst,
--    never resets you. Auto Reset (Main): 10 s with no weapon out and
--    a weapon in the backpack. Change-only HUD, memoised lookups.
--
--  Stop with _G.FeedAMosquito.stop().
--==================================================================
